<rules>
<rule id="90d4-5f94-0a98-07a5" name="Allies Matrix: Exercitus Imperialis" hidden="false">
<description>Allies Matrix - At the Height of the Heresy. Allies and Brothers: Alpha Legion, Blood Angels, Dark Angels, Death Guard, Emperor's Children, Exercitus Imperialis, Imperial Fists, Iron Hands, Mechanicum, Night Lords, Questoris Households, Raven Guard, Salamanders, Solar Auxilia, Sons of Horus, Space Wolves, Thousand Sons, Ultramarines, White Scars, Word Bearers, World Eaters. Conditional Alliance: Blackshields (The Lost and the Damned). Sworn Enemies: Daemons of the Ruinstorm. Apply the chart separately to every pair of detachments in the army. An alliance never overrides army-building restrictions, allegiance requirements or the specific wording of a unit, ability or item of wargear.</description>
</rule>
</rules>
<costs>
<cost name="pts" typeId="pts0-0000-0000-0001" value="0" />
</costs>
</selectionEntry>
